------------------------------------------------------------------------------
T1_PK                                    BTREE    UNIQUE        I2 ASC,
                                                                I1 ASC
T1_UK                                    BTREE    UNIQUE        I3 ASC,
                                                                I2 ASC,
                                                                I1 ASC
[ PRIMARY KEY ]                                                 
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
I2, I1
